Third-party components bundled with Vela

Vela is distributed as a Windows binary that dynamically links (via DLLs) to
the runtime components listed below. Vela's own source code is under the MIT
license (see LICENSE). The bundled components each carry their own license;
the summaries and pointers below satisfy the attribution / notice
requirements for the LGPL and zlib licenses in particular.

For end users: nothing you do with Vela is restricted by these licenses. For
developers or redistributors: read the actual upstream license texts (each
project ships one) before repackaging.

