1. FFmpeg  (LGPL v2.1 or later)
   Website: https://ffmpeg.org
   License: https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html

   Vela links dynamically to the LGPL configuration of FFmpeg. The
   avcodec / avformat / avfilter / avutil / swscale / swresample DLLs
   shipped next to Vela.exe are the unmodified upstream builds from the
   vcpkg registry (https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg). Under LGPL 2.1,
   Vela is not required to be LGPL itself as long as (a) users can
   replace the FFmpeg DLLs with a compatible build (they can - the DLLs
   sit next to Vela.exe and any ABI-compatible FFmpeg build works), and
   (b) this notice is included in the distribution.

   The full LGPL v2.1 text is available at:
