7. Microsoft Windows fonts  (system-provided)
   Vela loads Segoe UI, Malgun Gothic, Gulim, Batang, and Malgun Bold
   from C:\Windows\Fonts at run time. These are provided by the
   operating system; Vela does not bundle any font files.
